        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Aerobic one-pot self-assembly: Gd(NO3)3·xH2O (0.25 mmol), Zn(NO3)2·6H2O (75 mg, 0.25 mmol), H4L (140 mg, 0.5 mmol), tBuONa (100 mg, 1 mmol) and Et3N (300 µL, 2.15 mmol) were stirred in 25 mL MeOH for 2 h. The solution was filtered and allowed to stand; X-ray quality crystals formed by slow evaporation of the mother liquor over 5 days.",
